WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.792
KEVIN FEIGE
We've been waiting to tell the story

00:00:02.786 --> 00:00:04.828
of Natasha Romanoff for years.

00:00:05.215 --> 00:00:09.632
It was one of the great
post-Infinity Saga opportunities.

00:00:09.643 --> 00:00:12.227
How to evolve into Phase 4.

00:00:13.024 --> 00:00:15.024
NATASHA ROMANOFF
I'm done running from my past.

00:00:17.792 --> 00:00:20.292
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
Natasha is a product of all these films

00:00:20.292 --> 00:00:21.358
that we've done.

00:00:21.768 --> 00:00:23.435
KEVIN FEIGE
You will look at the past again

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:26.358
in a new light, and we are
sowing the seeds of new characters

00:00:26.361 --> 00:00:27.884
into the future of the MCU.

00:00:32.371 --> 00:00:34.371
NATASHA ROMANOFF
It's good to see you too, sis.

00:00:35.951 --> 00:00:37.785
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
Kevin's genius is that he thinks in this

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:40.259
really huge, unexpected way.

00:00:41.086 --> 00:00:42.711
KEVIN FEIGE
You know a lot about the characters

00:00:42.713 --> 00:00:45.046
already, so there are
presumptions that you bring to it.

00:00:45.046 --> 00:00:46.463
YELENA BELOVA
Ok, you got a plan or shall I

00:00:46.443 --> 00:00:47.360
just stay duck and cover?

00:00:47.339 --> 00:00:49.506
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
My plan was to drive us away!

00:00:49.514 --> 00:00:51.098
KEVIN FEIGE
And we like to subvert those.

00:00:51.118 --> 00:00:52.577
YELENA BELOVA
Well, your plan sucks.

00:00:55.538 --> 00:00:56.747
RACHEL WEISZ
Marvel's created something

00:00:56.744 --> 00:00:58.662
absolutely extraordinary.

00:00:59.967 --> 00:01:01.926
KEVIN FEIGE
We're excited for people to go to theatres

00:01:01.911 --> 00:01:06.203
to see and experience this movie
in its place in the pantheon of the MCU.

00:01:08.051 --> 00:01:09.259
NATASHA ROMANOFF
I made my choice.

00:01:11.744 --> 00:01:13.078
I'm done running.

